Package: famnesia
Title: Anonymising Familias Files
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Magnus Dehli", "Vigeland", , "m.d.vigeland@medisin.uio.no", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9134-4962"))
Description: A 'shiny' application for anonymising files exported from the
    'Familias' software for forensic kinship analysis. Pedigrees, marker
    data, allele frequencies and mutation models can be masked or
    modified, with options for preserving likelihood ratios exactly. The
    application is built on the 'pedsuite' packages for pedigree analysis.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/magnusdv/famnesia,
BugReports: https://github.com/magnusdv/famnesia/issues
